From: yinjiayi <yinjiayi@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Use GNUInstallDirs full paths in pkg-config metadata

The export destinations must remain relative for relocatable staged CMake
consumers. The pkg-config template instead needs absolute configured paths;
bare lib64/include are not prefix-relative pkg-config variables.
License: MIT
Upstream-Status: Pending
--- a/tinycbor.pc.in
+++ b/tinycbor.pc.in
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 prefix=@CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX@
 exec_prefix=@CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX@
-libdir=@CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR@
-includedir=@CMAKE_INSTALL_INCLUDEDIR@
+libdir=@CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_LIBDIR@
+includedir=@CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_INCLUDEDIR@
 
 Name: TinyCBOR
 Description: A tiny CBOR encoder and decoder library
